  "description": "Canonical, versioned event-query fixtures for indexers consuming Talos Soroban contract events by topic and ledger range. Consumers load this JSON directly (TypeScript, Python, Rust). Any change that alters decoding MUST bump spec_version and follow the versioning rules in contracts/EVENTS.md. v1.3.0: governance events now carry typed struct payloads (EventProposalCreated, EventVoteCast, EventProposalStatusChanged) instead of raw tuples; full action/vote/execution fixture bundle added.",
  "bounds": {
    "min_page_size": 1,
    "max_page_size": 100,
    "max_ledger_span": 10000
  },
